lion dollars.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_938cc809ef944717a48558bb","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":{"content":"- [x] Find monthly nominal net budget receipts from Corporate income taxes for FY 2021\n- [x] Extract data from Treasury Bulletin resources\n- [x] Compute quartiles (Q1, Q3) using Type 7 linear-interpolation method\n- [x] Round intermediate values to tenths of billions\n- [x] Calculate H Spread (Q3 - Q1)\n- [x] Round final answer to nearest hundredths place\n- [ ] Write answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
